  "plain": "In the 1950s, a doctor and psychic researcher named Andrija Puharich is said to have met Allen Dulles, who ran the CIA during that decade. An unnamed researcher who has studied Puharich's journals says they record the meeting: \"He met with Dulles.\" If true, it would put Puharich's psychic research in direct contact with the head of American intelligence."
